==Location and Uses==
==={{ALttP|-}}===
In {{ALttP}}, Apples are a health-restoring item that can only be obtained by dashing into [[Tree]]s with the [[Pegasus Shoes]]. Apples are also the answer to one of the [[Lumberjack]]'s [[Lumberjack's Riddles|Riddles]] in {{ALttP&FS}}.

==={{LANS|-}}===
In {{LANS}}, Apples are found growing on certain Trees scattered on the [[Overworld]] of [[Koholint Island]]. [[Link]] can perform a [[Dash Attack]] into these Trees to make them fall on the ground. He can then pick them up and eat them to restore some [[Heart]]s.{{How Many}}

==={{OoT|-}}===
{{Stub|OoT3D}}

==={{TP|-}}===
In {{TP}}, Apples are found in the stalls of [[Hyrule Castle Town#South Road|Hyrule Castle Town's South Road]]. However, [[Link]] cannot actually obtain or use them.

==={{ALBW|-}}===
In {{ALBW}}, Apples can recover one [[Heart]]. They can also be stored in [[Bottle]]s by catching them with the [[Bug Net|Net]]. Next to [[Link's House#A Link Between Worlds|Link's House]], an Apple tree grows Apples with every [[StreetPass]] encounter, starting with three and reaching a maximum of 20.

==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Apple}}
In {{BotW}}, Apples are [[Material]]s that can be used in [[Cooking]] [[Food]]. This red fruit can be found growing on various trees throughout [[Hyrule]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They're also sold by the [[General Shoppe]] and the travelling [[Merchant]] [[Gartan]] near [[Gerudo Town]]. Regular [[Hinox]] also drop Apples when defeated.

Apples can be eaten fresh to heal half of a [[Heart]]. They can also be made into [[Baked Apple]]s by exposing them to [[Fire]],<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> which heal three-quarters of a Heart.<ref name="BotW Inventory 2"/><ref name="BotW Old Man"/> At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Apples can be used to create [[Red Dye]].

During the [[Side Quest]] "[[Riddles of Hyrule]]", [[Walton]] will ask [[Link]] to bring him something small, red, round, and sweet.<ref name="BotW Walton"/> If Link drops an Apple on the leaf in front of Walton, he will cheer before moving on to the next riddle.<ref name="BotW Walton 2"/>

