==Other Appearances==
==={{MNPTP|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
[[File:MNPTP Apple Sprite.png|left|50px]]
The fifth puzzle in the ''How to Play Picross'' series depicts an Apple.
{{Noncanon|End}}

==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
Apples can be found by breaking [[Object]]s such as [[Wooden Box]]es. They can be consumed to heal a Warrior's [[Life Gauge]].{{How Many}} There is an initial capacity limit of three Apples, though it is possible to increase this capacity to hold four Apples instead.{{How}} If an Apple makes contact with [[Fire]], it will turn into a [[Baked Apple]], which heals more [[Heart]]s.
{{Noncanon|End}}

